or:#1a1a1a;\">74.99</div><div style=\"font-size:0.75em;font-weight:600;color:#1261c4;margin-top:3px;\">▼ -1.39%</div></div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4e9f0;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;flex:1;min-width:90px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#9ea7b4;margin-bottom:4px;\">금선물</div><div style=\"font-size:1.0em;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a;\">4,342.80</div><div style=\"font-size:0.75em;font-weight:600;color:#e83c3c;margin-top:3px;\">▲ +0.27%</div></div></div><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;font-weight:600;color:#666e7a;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">핵심 종목 & 한국 연관주</div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e4e9f0;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.88em;background:#ffffff;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#ebf0f8;\"><th style=\"padding:9px 14px;text-align:left;color:#666e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:0.82em;border-bottom:2px solid #e4e9f0;\">종목</th><th style=\"padding:9px 14px;text-align:right;color:#666e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:0.82em;border-bottom:2px solid #e4e9f0;\">현재가</th><th style=\"padding:9px 14px;text-align:right;color:#666e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:0.82em;border-bottom:2px solid #e4e9f0;\">등락</th><th style=\"padding:9px 14px;text-align:left;color:#666e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:0.82em;border-bottom:2px solid #e4e9f0;\">한국 연관</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e9f0;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:0.9em;\">엔비디아</span><span style=\"color:#9ea7b4;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">NVDA</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e9f0;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:0.9em;\">207.41</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e9f0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 7px;background:#fff0f0;